---
// Hero section
---
<section class="px-6 pt-10 pb-16 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
  <header class="flex justify-between items-center mb-20 gap-4 flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-serif text-ink">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sage-deep"></span>
      <span class="font-semibold tracking-tight">Cataí</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-3 items-center text-sm text-ink-soft">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-soft text-ink font-medium tracking-wide">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sage-deep animate-pulse"></span>
        em construção
      </span>
      <a href="#ajudar" class="text-ink/70 hover:text-ink no-underline">ajudar</a>
      <a href="#" class="text-ink/70 hover:text-ink no-underline">github</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft font-medium mb-6 flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-6 h-px bg-ink/20"></span>
        recicláveis · catadores · bairro
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(56px,9vw,132px)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink m-0 font-normal">
        Cata<span class="italic text-sage-deep">í</span>.
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-[clamp(20px,2.4vw,26px)] leading-[1.35] text-ink max-w-[540px] mt-7 mb-0 tracking-tight">
        Recicláveis sem desperdício,<br/>
        catadores <span class="border-b-2 border-sage-deep/60">sem rota perdida</span>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft max-w-[480px] mt-8">
        Um app open-source que conecta quem tem material reciclável a quem coleta.
        Sem pagamento, sem marketplace, sem rastreio. Só um caminho mais curto entre
        o material e a cooperativa.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-3 mt-10 flex-wrap">
        <a href="mailto:ola@catai.app?subject=Quero%20ser%20avisado"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-[22px] py-3.5 rounded-full bg-ink text-paper no-underline text-[15px] font-medium hover:-translate-y-px transition">
          Quero ser avisado quando lançar →
        </a>
        <a href="#"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-[22px] py-3.5 rounded-full text-ink no-underline border-[1.5px] border-ink/20 text-[15px] font-medium">
          Ver o código no GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 text-[13px] text-ink-soft flex items-center gap-2.5 opacity-85">
        <span class="italic font-serif text-base">cata-í</span>
        <span class="w-4 h-px bg-ink/20"></span>
        <span>cata + aí. quem cata, ali, perto.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- App preview placeholder — implementar como componente PhoneMock -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <div class="w-[300px] h-[620px] rounded-[44px] bg-ink/5 border border-ink/10 grid place-items-center">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft">[ tela do app ]</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
